30, 2026 and 2025, respectively.</span></p><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_a63317e9-3fb7-4de2-b11c-d07909fb9835" contextRef="C_72c97717-74b9-4490-aca0-fadcc0d71b97" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseLiabilityMaturityTableTextBlock" escape="true" continuedAt="F_a63317e9-3fb7-4de2-b11c-d07909fb9835_1"><p style="text-indent:2.667%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The future maturities of operating lease liabilities are as f</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">ollows:</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p>
