       </table><p style="text-indent:2.667%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:super;font-size:6.7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">(1) </span><ix:footnote id="FNT_d8b21bd5-4fb2-44fb-827e-2623d1da8152" xml:lang="en-US"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Due to the Company reporting net loss for the three and six months ended June 30, 2025</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, there are </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_cad04657-fd05-4fc9-93e0-e2a5097f7392" contextRef="C_e0287ba0-1ffe-40b3-97cd-c05da059e85d" name="bigc:DilutiveSecuritiesCommonShares" unitRef="U_shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen"><ix:nonFraction id="F_a950cdee-a1ad-44c2-ada4-edee6f541d6d" contextRef="C_6969d049-74e3-41db-a65b-649e4e1c8dca" name="bigc:DilutiveSecuritiesCommonShares" unitRef="U_shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> common shares added to calculate diluted EPS because the effect would be anti-dilutive.</span></ix:footnote></p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_9d774b58-4395-4bc9-a6b6-2ca3cbc2faaa" contextRef="C_72c97717-74b9-4490-aca0-fadcc0d71b97" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfAntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareTextBlock" escape="true"><p style="text-indent:2.667%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roma